ui-options-mute-others-pipboy-music = Mute music from other Pip-Boys
ui-options-mute-others-pipboy-music-tooltip = When enabled, you will not hear music from other players' Pip-Boys. When disabled, you will.
ui-options-mute-others-portable-media-player-music = Mute music from other media players
ui-options-mute-others-portable-media-player-music-tooltip = When enabled, you will not hear music from other players' media players. When disabled, you will.
